#. Translators: Title of the add-on's settings panel.
#. Translators: Name of the add-on's category in the input gestures dialog.
msgid "Word language switching"
msgstr "Sprecherwechsel in Word"

#. Translators: Label of a checkbox in the add-on's settings panel.
msgid "&Enable voice switching on language changes in Word"
msgstr "Sprecherwechsel bei Sprachwechseln in Word &aktivieren"

#. Translators: Label of a checkbox in the add-on's settings panel.
msgid "Strip &dialects (e.g. report en_GB as plain en to the synthesizer)"
msgstr "&Dialekte entfernen (z. B. en_GB als en an die Sprachausgabe melden)"

#. Translators: Label of an edit field in the add-on's settings panel.
msgid "Language &mappings (format: en_GB=en_US;fr_CA=fr_FR):"
msgstr "Sprach&zuordnungen (Format: en_GB=en_US;fr_CA=fr_FR):"

#. Translators: Description of a script in the input gestures dialog.
msgid "Shows diagnostic information about language switching in Word"
msgstr "Gibt Diagnose-Informationen zum Sprecherwechsel in Word aus"

#. Translators: Title of the diagnostics browseable message.
msgid "Word language switching diagnostics"
msgstr "Diagnose: Sprecherwechsel in Word"

#. Translators: Spoken if the diagnostics window could not be shown.
msgid "Diagnostics written to the NVDA log"
msgstr "Diagnose wurde ins NVDA-Protokoll geschrieben"

#. Translators: Description of a script in the input gestures dialog.
msgid "Toggles automatic voice switching for language changes in Microsoft Word"
msgstr ""
"Schaltet den automatischen Sprecherwechsel bei Sprachwechseln in Microsoft "
"Word ein oder aus"

#. Translators: Spoken when the add-on has been enabled.
msgid "Word language switching on"
msgstr "Sprecherwechsel in Word eingeschaltet"

#. Translators: Spoken when the add-on has been disabled.
msgid "Word language switching off"
msgstr "Sprecherwechsel in Word ausgeschaltet"

#. Translators: Summary/title for this add-on
#. to be shown on installation and add-on information found in add-on store
msgid "Word Language Switching"
msgstr "Sprecherwechsel in Word"

#. Translators: Long description to be shown for this add-on on add-on information from add-on store
msgid ""
"Automatic voice switching for marked language changes in Microsoft Word and "
"Outlook.\n"
"The add-on obtains the language marked in the document via the Word object "
"model and feeds it\n"
"into NVDA's automatic language switching, so multilingual documents are "
"read with the matching\n"
"voice (e.g. neural/natural voices via OneCore or SAPI 5) - just like on the "
"web.\n"
"Requires \"Automatic language switching\" to be enabled in NVDA's speech "
"settings.\n"
"Includes optional dialect stripping and language code mappings for "
"synthesizers\n"
"that only match specific language codes."
msgstr ""
"Automatischer Sprecherwechsel bei ausgezeichneten Sprachwechseln in "
"Microsoft Word und Outlook.\n"
"Die Erweiterung ermittelt die im Dokument ausgezeichnete Sprache über das "
"Word-Objektmodell und speist sie\n"
"in NVDAs automatischen Sprachenwechsel ein, sodass mehrsprachige Dokumente "
"mit der passenden Stimme\n"
"(z. B. Neural-/Natural-Stimmen über OneCore oder SAPI 5) gelesen werden – "
"wie im Web.\n"
"Erfordert die aktivierte Option „Automatischer Sprachenwechsel“ in NVDAs "
"Sprachausgaben-Einstellungen.\n"
"Enthält optional Dialekt-Entfernung und Sprachcode-Zuordnungen für "
"Synthesizer,\n"
"die nur bestimmte Sprachcodes erkennen."

#. Translators: what's new content for the add-on version to be shown in the add-on store
msgid ""
"First public release: language detection via the Word object model,\n"
"settings panel with dialect stripping and language mappings, diagnostics "
"script."
msgstr ""
"Erste öffentliche Version: Spracherkennung über das Word-Objektmodell,\n"
"Einstellungs-Panel mit Dialekt-Entfernung und Sprachzuordnungen, Diagnose-"
"Skript."
